          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 82582,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Często będziemy mieć do czynienia z różnymi zbiorami danych, które powinniśmy połączyć w jeden, na przykład wartość sprzedaży w ciągu weekendu.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"sales_sat = [\" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sales_sun = [\" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Plus operator",
            "id": 82583,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aby połączyć dwa zestawy danych, takie jak te w <code>dataset_1</code> i <code>dataset_2</code>, używamy nazw list oraz operatora <code>+</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"dataset_1 = [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"dataset_2 = [\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(dataset_1 + dataset_2)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"69\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[1, 2, 3, 4, 5]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>dataset_1</code>, następnie <code>+</code> i na końcu <code>dataset_2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Użyj <code>+</code>, aby połączyć dwie listy. Najpierw pojawią się wartości z lewej listy, a potem wartości z prawej.</p><p>Połącz zestawy danych tak, aby kod wyświetlił <code>[4, 5, 1, 2, 3]</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"dataset_1\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"dataset_2\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"[\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"dataset_2\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"+\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"dataset_1\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[4, 5, 1, 2, 3]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>dataset_2</code>, następnie <code>+</code> i na końcu <code>dataset_1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Appended at the end",
            "id": 82584,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podczas używania <code>+</code> druga lista jest dołączana na końcu pierwszej listy.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"dataset_1 = [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"dataset_2 = [\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(dataset_1 + dataset_2)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[1, 2, 3, 4, 5]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>+</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Different types",
            "id": 82585,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Możemy również użyć <code>+</code>, aby połączyć listy zawierające wartości różnych typów, takie jak numeryczna <code>seats</code> i logiczna <code>taken</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"seats = [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"taken = [\" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(seats + taken)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"23\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[1, 2, 3, True, True, False]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>seats</code>, a następnie <code>taken</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Za pomocą <code>+</code> możesz łączyć listy zawierające wartości różnych typów.</p><p>Połącz liczbowe <code>seats</code> i logiczne <code>taken</code>, najpierw miejsca, aby kod wyświetlił <code>[1, 2, 3, True, True, False]</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"seats = [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"taken = [\" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(seats + taken)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"*\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[1, 2, 3, True, True, False]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>seats</code>, następnie <code>+</code> i na końcu <code>taken</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Save in variable",
            "id": 82586,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aby ponownie użyć połączonej listy, możemy zapisać ją w zmiennej, tak jak tutaj w przypadku <code>combined</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"dataset_1 = [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"dataset_2 = [\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"combined = dataset_1 + dataset_2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(combined)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"74\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[1, 2, 3, 4, 5]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>combined</code>, następnie <code>=</code> i na końcu <code>dataset_1 + dataset_2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Połącz oba zbiory danych, umieszczając <code>dataset_1</code> jako pierwszy, i zapisz wynik w <code>combined</code>, aby kod wyświetlił <code>[1, 2, 3, 4, 5]</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"dataset_1 = [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"dataset_2 = [\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"combined = dataset_1 + dataset_2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(combined)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[1, 2, 3, 4, 5]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>combined</code>, następnie <code>=</code>, <code>dataset_1</code>, <code>+</code> i na końcu <code>dataset_2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Plus operator",
            "id": 82669,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co robi operator <code>+</code>, gdy używa się go z dwiema listami?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Łączy elementy dwóch list w nową listę</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dodaje każdy element z jednej listy do każdego elementu drugiej listy</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Łączy elementy dwóch list w nową listę.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jaką nową listę utworzy <code>[1, 2] + [3, 4]</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[1, 2, 3, 4]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[4, 6]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[[1, 2], [3, 4]]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>[1, 2, 3, 4]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Appended at the end",
            "id": 82670,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podczas kodowania <code>list_1 + list_2</code> w jakiej kolejności elementy pojawią się na nowej liście?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Elementy <code>list_1</code> pojawią się jako pierwsze, a następnie elementy <code>list_2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Elementy obu list zostaną losowo wymieszane</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Elementy <code>list_1</code> pojawią się jako pierwsze, a następnie elementy <code>list_2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jeśli <code>first = [\"A\", \"B\"]</code>, a <code>second = [\"C\", \"D\"]</code>, co utworzy <code>first + second</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[\"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"D\"]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[\"C\", \"D\", \"A\", \"B\"]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[\"A\", \"C\", \"B\", \"D\"]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>[\"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"D\"]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Different types",
            "id": 82671,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jakie typy wartości mogą mieć listy, które łączymy?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dowolny typ</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tylko ten sam typ</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dowolny typ.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co utworzy <code>[\"id\"] + [7, True]</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[\"id\", 7, True]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Wystąpi błąd, ponieważ typy wartości są różne.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[\"id\", \"7\", \"True\"]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>[\"id\", 7, True]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Save in variable",
            "id": 82672,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jak możemy ponownie wykorzystać listę otrzymaną przez połączenie dwóch list?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Zapisujemy to w zmiennej </item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nie możemy użyć tego ponownie, możemy wyświetlić to tylko raz</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Zapisujemy to w zmiennej .</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wynik działania <code>first + second</code> będzie potrzebny później. Który wiersz zapisze połączoną listę?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>combined = first + second</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(first + second)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>first + second</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>combined = first + second</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Plus operator ",
            "id": 82674,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Użyj <code>+</code>, aby połączyć dwie listy przechowujące tempo wzrostu rośliny.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"growth_rate_1 = [\" /><text value=\"0.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0.7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0.8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"growth_rate_2 = [\" /><text value=\"0.8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0.6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0.6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(growth_rate_1 + growth_rate_2)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"86\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[0.5, 0.7, 0.8, 0.8, 0.6, 0.6]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>+</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Appended at the end",
            "id": 82676,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Połącz listy <code>customers</code> i <code>order_number</code> tak, aby najpierw znalazły się imiona klientów.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"customers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jess&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mike&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lynn&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"order_number = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(customers + order_number)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"93\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Jess', 'Mike', 'Lynn', 3, 1, 2]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>customers</code>, następnie <code>+</code> i na końcu <code>order_number</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Połącz listy <code>customers</code> i <code>order_number</code> tak, aby imiona znalazły się jako pierwsze i wyświetliła się lista <code>['Jess', 'Mike', 'Lynn', 3, 1, 2]</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"customers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jess&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mike&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lynn&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"order_number = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(customers + order_number)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Jess', 'Mike', 'Lynn', 3, 1, 2]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>customers</code>, następnie <code>+</code> i na końcu <code>order_number</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Different types",
            "id": 82675,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Połącz listy <code>t⁠e⁠a⁠m⁠_⁠1</code> i <code>t⁠e⁠a⁠m⁠_⁠2</code>, aby nazwy graczy i wyniki zostały wyświetlone na jednej liście.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"team_1 = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ana&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"78\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"team_2 = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Kim&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"57\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sam&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(team_1 + team_2)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"86\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Ana', 78, 'Joe', 80, 'Kim', 57, 'Sam', 60]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>+</code>, a następnie <code>team_2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Połącz <code>team_1</code> i <code>team_2</code> w jedną listę, umieszczając <code>team_1</code> jako pierwszy, aby kod wyświetlił <code>['Ana', 78, 'Joe', 80, 'Kim', 57, 'Sam', 60]</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"team_1 = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ana&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"78\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"team_2 = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Kim&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"57\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sam&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(team_1 + team_2)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"77\" /><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"*\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Ana', 78, 'Joe', 80, 'Kim', 57, 'Sam', 60]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>team_1</code>, następnie <code>+</code> i na końcu <code>team_2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
